## Step 10: M&S 17 — M&S Validated

*"The M&S developer shall validate the M&S."*

```bash
find . \( -name "VALIDATION*" -o -name "*validation*" \) -not -path "./.git/*" \
  -not -path "./*__pycache__*" | head -10
